  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Horticulture Market Acceleration Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of HortiMAP is to support market actors to chart their own course towards a vibrant, sustainable Ugandan horticul- ture sector. The goal of the program is to transform the horticul- ture sector to a modern, efficient, competitive, technology and knowledge-driven sector though increased productivity, reduced food losses, improved access to rewarding markets, strengthen resilience to shocks, and a strong and facilitating government. The project contributes to poverty reduction, adequate food and nutrition security and job creation through an inclusive, competi- tive, and transformative horticulture sector HortiMAP works on three areas: Increased productivity, improved access to markets and strengthened service provision within the value chain project.</narrative>
  </description>
